WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.420
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:35.500
Kaiba, you said your past only consists of hate and anger.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.410
But no past is meaningless.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:43.660
The past accumulates into the present and leads to your future.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.260
Even with all that hate, it's still weak!

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:50.360
Kaiba, I'll defeat you!

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:55.030
As a rival who fought through Battle City and also as a friend!

00:01:55.030 --> 00:02:01.030
The Blazing Road of a Scrub
Jonouchi vs Kaiba

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:33.700
Kaiba, hate cannot lead to true victory.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:37.000
Use this defeat to overcome your hate.

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:40.980
My Battle City...

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:46.770
With the hate I got from Gozaburo...

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:50.970
...I stand on top of the Duel Tower, the monument of my revenge.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:54.920
Yugi...

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:58.220
My goal is to defeat you.

00:02:58.530 --> 00:02:59.570
My...

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.600
The Duel King title...

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:14.500
I... lost.

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:18.810
The winner is Yugi Muto!

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.180
Yugi!

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.110
Everyone!

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:31.260
Jonouchi!

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:33.000
You did it, Yugi!

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:36.660
Jonouchi!  I knew you'd be okay!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.860
Of course!

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.600
I won't die that easily!

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:46.700
Not until I fight you as a true duelist.

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:47.970
Yeah.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:52.310
Thank goodness!  Truly!

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.240
You saw it, right?

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:59.650
Red-Eyes heroically protected Yugi until the end!

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:01.930
But it doesn't belong to you yet.

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:05.720
Don't worry!  It'll get it back soon!

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:10.030
Thank you from the bottom of my heart, Jonouchi.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:15.040
Is this the end for me?

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.100
Don't lose, Yugi.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.070
Jonouchi.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:28.500
You told me that your hand always has potential.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.950
My hand!

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.840
Don't give up, Yugi.

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:34.000
A true duelist never gives up.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:41.240
You not only gave me Red-Eyes, you also gave me strength.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.040
My brother lost?

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:49.400
It can't be true!

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:55.020
My strongest deck...

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.770
My strongest servant...

00:04:57.850 --> 00:05:00.120
My strategy was perfect.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:03.210
My hand was perfect!

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:05.860
But I lost.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:09.590
Kaiba.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:14.520
Even though I won, we were evenly matched.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.690
Are you pitying me, Yugi?

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:22.460
I respect your skills as a duelist.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.130
But let me tell you this.

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:31.610
You lost against a monster in your heart named hate!

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:34.540
What?  A monster named hate?

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:38.980
A duelists' battle isn't just between the monsters in the cards.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:44.060
There's anger, hate and greed in our hearts.

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:47.360
The enemy is also inside us!

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:53.030
Overcoming them will open the path to becoming a true duelist!

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:55.470
True duelist...

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:59.900
That's my Battle City.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:05.340
Jonouchi also keeps fighting to get there.

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:13.680
To become a true duelist and regain his cherished card!

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:20.120
Kaiba, I would've lost if I didn't have Red-Eyes in my hand at that time.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.660
Red-Eyes?

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:30.570
The Flute of Summoning Dragon's effect Special Summons Dragons from the hand.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:34.600
That effect doesn't only work for you!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:39.660
I had Red-Eyes B. Dragon in my hand!

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:43.220
Jonouchi gave me his precious card!

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:49.420
The card I received from a friend...

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:52.760
My friend's power brought me victory!

00:06:56.420 --> 00:06:57.490
Yugi...

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.930
Your friend's power?

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:06.870
How lame!  A victory only has value when you win it with your own hands!

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:10.600
I'll never need help from a friend!

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.030
Kaiba...

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:21.060
Since you were my rival, I was able to keep fighting for greater heights.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:30.700
Kaiba, it must be the same for you.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:35.730
So where's the boundary between a friend and a rival?

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:42.040
I don't need a friend's power.

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:46.830
To achieve the future I believe in, I'll grab the glory by myself!

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:49.460
Or else, it would be pointless!

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:53.100
I don't need anyone's help in my road of battle!

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.580
Kaiba...

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:59.680
But only the winner has the right to speak.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:02.260
My Battle City is over.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:05.030
I'll withdraw in silence.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:09.440
Due to the ante rule, take this card!

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:15.440
The God Card, Obelisk the Tormentor.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.500
Let's go, Mokuba.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.580
Brother!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.340
Wait, Kaiba!

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:27.620
Duel me!

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:32.300
I know you just lost, but let's see who finishes in third place.

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:34.290
Hey!

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:37.660
I said wait!

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.190
Is this a joke?

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:42.200
You don't need a friend's power?

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.470
I was like that before.

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:50.440
Hearing those words would disgust me.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:55.010
But I've changed since I met Yugi.

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:02.880
What can be seen but remains unseen...

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:06.260
I learned of friendship when I met Yugi.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.690
Jonouchi...

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:14.960
And I'll answer that friendship by becoming a true duelist and defeating Yugi!

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:18.200
That's my duel!  That's my Battle City!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.640
I'm not like you who's done after one defeat!

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:24.350
You should stop talking.

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:27.580
And I'll let it go as the ramblings of a scrub.

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:33.580
Jonouchi!  If you keep insulting my brother, I won't forgive you!

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:34.680
Be quiet!

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:37.520
Then I'll ask you, Mokuba!  How do you feel?

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:39.960
About what?

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:45.890
How's the way we feel about our friends different than how you feel about Kaiba?

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.900
Hey, Kaiba.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:55.700
To be honest, I thought you had a backbone.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:59.610
But you just want to be the big fish in a small pond.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:04.180
I won't let you mock me any further.

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:05.880
Then it's decided!

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.620
Duel me, Kaiba!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:12.150
Dueling you is pointless.

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:14.000
It's a waste of my time.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.560
You got a big mouth!

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:22.220
But it's my credo that if anyone ever challenges me to a duel, I accept!

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:24.670
That's the spirit!

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:25.950
Jonouchi...

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:28.520
Brother...

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:32.200
A true duelist never needs his friends' help.

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:38.010
I'll prove that your ideas are weak and ridiculous!

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:40.450
I'm looking forward to it!

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:03.180
Yugi and Marik are in the finals.

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:05.770
The time of destiny is approaching.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:24.260
You're going to become a true duelist?

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:28.660
You'll learn that you have no chance of becoming one.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.600
I'm ready!

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.600
Bring it on!

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:37.330
Will Jonouchi be okay?

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:40.040
He's always been like that.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.840
He only fought those who were stronger than him.

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:52.220
But Jonouchi is much stronger now.

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:52.950
Yeah.

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:58.890
Jonouchi made it here by defeating many tough duelists.

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:04.320
Alligator's Sword, deal him damage with your Dragon Sword!

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.300
Trap Crush!

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:16.900
Go, Battle Warrior and Swordsman of Landstar!

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:22.780
And he was evenly matched against Marik's dark personality.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:23.920
Here I go!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:28.790
I tribute Lava Golem, Rocket Warrior and Panther Warrior!

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:34.630
I summon Gilford the Lightning!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:43.530
I activate Gilford the Lightning's effect!

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:52.560
Jonouchi's skills have greatly improved.

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:55.220
I won't be surprised if he defeats Kaiba.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:57.800
Do your best, Jonouchi.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:13.200
My turn.  I draw.

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:17.600
I'll defeat that scrub in an instant.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:21.180
You'll learn I'm on a whole different level than you.

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:24.060
I summon Ryu-Kishin Powered!

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:32.820
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:37.260
My set cards are Crush Card Virus and Shrink.

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:43.200
My deck destruction combo will infect your deck with a virus next turn.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:45.550
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.070
Nice!

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:52.240
Gearfried has more attack points than his monster!

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:53.680
I'll attack!

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:56.380
I summon Gearfried the Iron Knight!

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:02.000
Hey Kaiba!

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:08.600
I know your two set cards will try to weaken my monsters.

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:12.160
But you can't use Equip Spells on Gearfried!

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:17.420
I don't know what's going on, but Jonouchi seems to be thinking!

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:21.840
I feel Jonouchi will play better if he doesn't think-

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:22.680
Huh?

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:23.840
Where's Anzu?

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:26.880
Anzu?

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.920
She probably went to the bathroom.

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:31.000
All right!  Go, Jonouchi!

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:32.100
Yeah!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:35.920
Gearfried attacks Ryu-Kishin Powered!

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:41.880
Not bad for a scrub.

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:43.800
I flip over my spell!

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:44.940
Shrink!

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.840
Just as you predicted.

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:53.340
Shrink is a spell card that cuts a monster's attack points in half.

00:14:53.340 --> 00:14:57.520
But I'm not playing this spell on your monster!

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:58.440
What?

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:04.540
Oh no!  This strategy...

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:08.480
Got you!

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:14.560
When your monster attacks, my trap card Crush Card Virus activates!

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:22.570
My Dark Attribute monster with 1000 or lower attack points becomes the virus's host.

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:40.450
Jonouchi, it destroys the monsters on your field and in your deck!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:47.600
I knew it!

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:56.020
Crush Card Virus destroys monsters on the field, hand and deck with 1500 or more attack points!

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:57.730
That's his special combo!

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:00.760
My Jinzo...

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:03.560
My Gilford the Lightning...

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:07.170
Dammit, Kaiba!

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:10.540
Now your deck only has weak monsters.

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:13.850
Fitting for a scrub.

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:15.040
What?

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:18.430
We don't have to duel to know the result.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:20.940
You still have time to surrender.

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:22.450
Don't be silly!

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:25.860
I won't surrender!  We just begun!

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:28.390
This is a lame duel.

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:30.570
My turn.  I draw.

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:34.100
I have no monsters on my field.

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.500
This is bad!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.940
I summon La Jinn the Mystical Genie of the Lamp!

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:48.450
Hey!  Jonouchi is wide open!

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:50.160
This is bad!

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:52.420
Here I go!

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:57.220
La Jinn the Mystical Genie of the Lamp attacks you directly!

00:17:08.740 --> 00:17:09.960
You're...

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.140
Sis.

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:18.780
Marik!

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:20.950
You're Marik!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.050
Jonouchi...

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:28.180
Damn!

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:33.490
Due to his Virus, my deck is full of monsters with low attack points.

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.250
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.520
Graceful Dice.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:44.350
Okay then!  I summon Swordsman of Landstar!

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:52.720
I activate my spell card, Graceful Dice!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:58.680
Graceful Dice targets a monster with 500 or lower attack points.

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:03.200
And multiplies its attack points by the number he rolls.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:04.380
I see!

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:08.830
Jonouchi's strategy is to summon a monster with low attack points...

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:12.360
...and use his Dice to raise its attack points.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:16.100
But La Jinn has 1800 attack points.

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:20.540
Jonouchi has to roll a 4 or more!

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:24.410
Lady Luck, I'm counting on you!

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.470
All right!

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:53.120
I rolled a 4!

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:57.280
Swordsman of Landstar's attack points are multiplied by 4!

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:03.900
Wow!  He really rolled a 4!

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:07.620
Jonouchi is very lucky!

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:10.060
Nicely done, Jonouchi!

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:12.820
Phew.  That was close.

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:16.490
I barely have more attack points.

00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:19.160
All he has is luck.

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:20.220
Here I go!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:24.480
Swordsman of Landstar attacks La Jinn the Mystical Genie of the Lamp!

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:38.800
Now you know that viruses don't work on me!

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:42.350
Because "Idiots don't catch colds."

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:47.190
Back then...

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:49.820
Sis...

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:51.460
Rishido...

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:53.200
Marik!

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:55.730
Save Rishido from him!

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:59.710
You came to tell me that Rishido was in danger.

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:04.050
You've been hiding inside her since then?

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:05.960
That's right, Sis.

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:07.150
And I...

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:09.980
I learned everything through her.

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:14.510
You told the awful truth about the Ishtar family.

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:21.680
It seems to accept me.

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:23.540
Return it to the altar!

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:25.370
Be quiet!

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.000
Marik!  How dare you!

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:32.970
My body...

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:37.110
I'll kill you first, Father.

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.310
Don't!

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:45.520
Why did you never tell me what really happened?

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:46.800
Marik...

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:51.460
That my dark personality killed our father.

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:54.240
You knew, right?

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:58.370
That battling the Pharaoh in Battle City was the Ishtars' destiny-

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:00.900
No, that it was MY destiny.

00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:05.350
That's what the Millennium Necklace showed you.

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:06.900
I...

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:10.970
Even if you were ruled by the desire for revenge...

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:15.850
...I would obey destiny if it meant that you'd live!

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:22.120
But I wasn't strong enough to seal the darkness in my heart forever.

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:24.560
Without Rishido, I...

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:26.300
Marik...

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:30.880
I can't let my dark side do whatever he wants.

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:32.430
I will end this!

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:35.080
Wait, Marik!

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.370
Where are you going?

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:39.040
Sis!  Take care of Rishido!

00:21:39.260 --> 00:21:41.070
No!  You mustn't go!

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:42.770
Marik!

00:21:54.360 --> 00:22:01.460
Due to Kaiba's Crush Card Virus, Jonouchi lost all his monsters with high attack points.

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:06.480
But Jonouchi doesn't give up and keeps clawing at Kaiba.

00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:10.280
As for me, Marik is in control of my mind.

00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:13.170
I'm forced to fight Marik's dark side.

00:22:13.170 --> 00:22:16.380
What's going to happen to me?

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:21.600
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Blue-Eyes White Dragon vs Blue-Eyes White Dragon

00:22:21.600 --> 00:22:23.660
Duel, standby!

00:22:29.700 --> 00:22:38.610
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:39.110 --> 00:22:46.950
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:58.110
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:07.640
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:16.660
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:23:17.440 --> 00:23:22.170
I'll live feeling them

00:23:22.780 --> 00:23:27.360
For me to be me

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:35.810
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:41.450
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:41.970 --> 00:23:51.110
We'll both understand that someday
